    lane: "Staff",
    objective: "Make sure nobody new to your building spends their first month figuring out how things work by guessing. Most schools have an onboarding process that is entirely compliance, entirely paper, and entirely finished by the second day. This gives every new staff member one named partner and six specific human tasks to complete together in thirty days. It takes 20 minutes to set up and it is the single cheapest retention move available to you.",
