    beWord: "BE Consistent",
    lane: "Staff",
    objective: "Guarantee that every adult in your building gets an unscripted, non-business conversation with you on a rotation you cannot fudge. Write every staff member's name on a poker chip, keep them in a bowl on your desk, and pull three or four every morning. Those are your people for the day. The bowl removes the thing that quietly wrecks staff relationships in every school, which is that leaders unconsciously talk to the same fifteen people all year.",
