    lane: "Staff · Student",
    objective: "Choose a single thing your whole school does every week, all year, without exception, and start it in September while the year is still soft enough to shape. Not five things. One. A school's identity is built almost entirely out of what it repeats, and most schools repeat nothing on purpose. This is 25 minutes with your staff to pick the one and commit to it in public.",
