    leaderScript: "\"I want us to pick one thing this school does every week, all year, no exceptions. One. Not a list. And the test isn't whether it sounds good today, it's whether we'll still be doing it the third week of February when three people are out and the copier's broken. If it doesn't survive that day, it's not a tradition, it's a mood. I'd rather do one small thing 36 weeks in a row than five great things until October.\"",
