    lane: "Staff",
    objective: "Build, with your staff, a single page that answers the question every adult in your building asks twenty times a year: who do I go to for this? Unclear roles are not a chart problem, they are a culture problem. They produce the same three overworked people fielding everything, a handful of staff who never get asked for anything, and new hires who learn the system by embarrassing themselves. This fixes it in one meeting.",
