    lane: "Student",
    objective: "Give every student a role with a name, a description, and a consequence if it does not get done. Belonging is not only about being liked, it is about being needed, and a kid who holds a job that matters has a reason to be there on the days when nothing else is working. This is a 20-minute classroom block in September, run building-wide on the same day.",
