    leaderScript: "\"Starting today, every student in this school has a job. Not a chore, a job. Something this building actually needs done, and something we'd notice if it didn't happen. Mine is that I'm at the front door every morning. Ms. Rivera's is that she reads these announcements. Yours goes up on the board in your room today, and it's real. If your job doesn't feel real, come tell me and we'll fix it.\"",
