    lane: "Leader · Family",
    objective: "Go through everything your school is doing in November and find the places where it assumes a student has a family, a home, a table, food, and a reason to be grateful. Then fix the three worst. November is the month schools accidentally tell some of their kids that the version of life the building is celebrating is not theirs. This is 25 minutes of honest reading and three concrete changes.",
