    objective: "Walk into a classroom in December, take over for one period, and send the teacher out. Not to a meeting. Out. To grade, to nap in their car, to eat a hot lunch, to call the pediatrician they have been meaning to call since October. This is the cheapest and most credible thing a school leader can do in the hardest month of the year, and it costs nothing but your calendar.",
