    objective: "Design the first morning back from winter break on purpose. Most schools treat it as a soft restart and spend the day on logistics. For a meaningful slice of your students, two weeks at home was the hardest stretch of their year, and the first morning back is the moment they either get caught or get missed. This is 20 minutes of planning that decides which.",
