    lane: "Student",
    objective: "Run a kindness activity that produces no wall, no chart, no tally, and no recognition. Students find the work in the building that nobody notices and nobody thanks anyone for, and then do it anonymously for a month. Most February kindness programming rewards visible kindness, which teaches students that the point of being good is being seen being good. This teaches the opposite, and it takes 20 minutes to set up.",
