    leaderScript: "\"I'm calling because I'd like you to come Thursday at 5:30. It's an hour, there's food, and honestly there's nothing to it. No presentation, nobody's going to ask you to volunteer, and you don't need to bring anything or prepare anything. We just play board games at the tables. Bring the little ones, that's fine, they're welcome in the room. I'd really like to see you there.\"",
